        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mike Robbie, Joe Robbie\n- Organizations: Miami Dolphins\n- Roles: General Manager, owner, founder, attorney, politician\n\nFacts:\n- Joe Robbie was born on July 7, 1916, and died on January 7, 1990.\n- Joe Robbie was an American attorney, politician, and the principal founder of the Miami Dolphins.\n- Mike Robbie was born on April 5, 1943.\n- Mike Robbie is the son of Joe Robbie.\n- Mike Robbie is a former General Manager of the Miami Dolphins, and Joe Robbie was a former owner of the team.",
